  "name": "Black Olive and Rosemary Focaccia",
  "subtitle": "Rosemary focaccia with olives, tomatoes, and cheese",
  "description": "A savory Italian-inspired focaccia topped with black olives, sliced tomatoes, garlic, rosemary, and grated cheese.",
